The Pearson correlation coefficients are as follows.
</span>Blocksworld:<span id="S4.F7.40.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> [<span id="S4.F7.40.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#997373;">0.48</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.2.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#990000;">0.6</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.2.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;">0.67</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.2.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000099;">0.66</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.2.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#994D00;">0.63</span>]; </span>BabyAI:<span id="S4.F7.40.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> [<span id="S4.F7.40.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#997373;">0.52</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.3.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#990000;">0.68</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.3.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;">0.7</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.3.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000099;">0.74</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.3.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#994D00;">0.8</span>]; </span>Logistics:<span id="S4.F7.40.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> [<span id="S4.F7.40.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#997373;">0.16</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.4.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#990000;">0.37</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.4.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;">0.73</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.4.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000099;">0.71</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.4.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#994D00;">0.77</span>]; </span>Sokoban:<span id="S4.F7.40.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> [<span id="S4.F7.40.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#997373;">0.53</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.5.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#990000;">0.12</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.5.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;">0.57</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.5.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000099;">0.62</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.5.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#994D00;">0.72</span>]; </span>AlfWorld:<span id="S4.F7.40.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> [<span id="S4.F7.40.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#997373;">0.46</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.6.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#990000;">0.74</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.6.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;">0.86</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.6.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000099;">0.55</span>, <span id="S4.F7.40.6.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#994D00;">0.87</span>].
